0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","review_id":"V0okL4G7JO-360-zBLLUjA","date":"2012-04-18T19:51:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9433755874633789,"text_excerpt":"I've been to Snake and Jake's about a handful of times and can say that I don't really remember much from it except for the fact that it's probably the diviest of dives. Seriously, everything is like one big clump, and I think the bar itself is in someone's garage. I don't believe there is a sign on the front except for Christmas lights. Apparently, people drink Schlitz when they come here. I hear if you are naked, you get a free tab, but don't know how true that is. There are definitely some interesting people that come here, mostly hipsters. The music is very hipster-y. I enjoy over-hearing people's conversations when I come here....quite humorous. Usually, this is a late-late night pla..."},{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","review_id":"HRTa2sjl7agoYniUgOD-qQ","date":"2011-08-26T02:35:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9411185383796692,"text_excerpt":"INFAMOUS! I'd heard many, many savory and unsavory things about Snake and Jake's. Having been, I wish I'd gone sooner. The ambience is perfect dive bar: not too crowded, cheaply lit (by Christmas lights that are rumored to be plugged in next door), and easy-going. All the folks I met were nice people, the bartender was great at her job, and the beer was cheap. A real unique taste of New Orleans, Snake's is a great place to go to get off the grid. I'd suggest stopping by late at night, especially if you've already been out for three or four hours."},{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","review_id":"pBty8nDxl62cfzFLNyR9UA","date":"2014-04-24T19:59:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9341573119163513,"text_excerpt":"Snake and Jake's is an awesome dive bar. The drinks are incredibly cheap and the ambiance is perfect. The lighting is just red Christmas lights fergodsakes. I live around the corner, so ending a night out here is just perfect. The bartenders are friendly and keep your drinks full. And the regulars are just chill and willing to have a conversation, unless of course they're too drunk, which is actually quite often. But you gotta love this place, it's just one of those classics."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","photo_id":"cm0d0n27xMideFnUv6c8Eg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/cm0d0n27xMideFnUv6c8Eg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8901722431182861},{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","photo_id":"w5Do40-SyPHRIrYEfnPGdQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/w5Do40-SyPHRIrYEfnPGdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8828099966049194},{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","photo_id":"gfDPEmQLGCsOrBVPJooing","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gfDPEmQLGCsOrBVPJooing.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8815999031066895},{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","photo_id":"yASWux8gI4OojGnjS5SWEQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yASWux8gI4OojGnjS5SWEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8446797132492065},{"business_id":"688utk-zc_7eA3HNhccevA","photo_id":"PYHeJHMKCgEPCRtvn6zTPA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PYHeJHMKCgEPCRtvn6zTPA.jpg"